+/*
+ * ADR-0031: the functional material layer.
+ *
+ * The only place `backdrop-filter` may appear in this repository. Blueprint
+ * section 14 still forbids decorative glass; what ADR-0031 permits is one
+ * bounded material that marks the boundary between floating chrome and the
+ * drawing underneath it, which is a question a flat surface answers less well
+ * in an edge-to-edge CAD workspace.
